A major competitor to the [[Org/Hildebrandt Corporation/index|Hildebrandt Corporation]], Ternion makes airframes for transporting cargo. Their specialty is multi-slip sliders that can quickly drop into an uninhabited world for traffic-free transport.

Ternion and Hildebrandt do not get along. Ternion accuses Hildebrandt of shooting its planes out of the sky.
